<com:TContent ID="body">

<h1>TActiveHiddenField Sample</h1>

<com:TActiveHiddenField ID="Hidden1" Value="alpha" OnValueChanged="valueChanged" />

<table class="sampletable">

<tr><td class="samplenote">
Read the hidden field on the server:
</td><td class="sampleaction">
<com:TActiveButton Text="Read the value" OnCallback="readValue" />
</td></tr>

<tr><td class="samplenote">
Write a new value from the server. The callback also updates the input on the client:
</td><td class="sampleaction">
<com:TActiveButton Text="Write a new value" OnCallback="writeValue" />
</td></tr>

<tr><td class="samplenote">
Write a value on the client, without a request. The next read shows it:
</td><td class="sampleaction">
<input type="button" value="Set the value to 'set by the browser'"
	onclick="document.getElementById('<%= $this->Hidden1->ClientID %>').value = 'set by the browser';" />
</td></tr>

<tr><td class="samplenote">
Server-side value:
</td><td class="sampleaction">
<com:TActiveLabel ID="Result" Text="Nothing has been read yet." />
</td></tr>

<tr><td class="samplenote">
The <tt>OnValueChanged</tt> event fires when the posted value differs from the previous
one:
</td><td class="sampleaction">
<com:TActiveLabel ID="ChangeLog" Text="The value has not changed yet." />
</td></tr>

</table>

</com:TContent>
